# Back-end

Linux Python project. A virtualenv already exists at `.venv`.

Before any Python command (scripts, tests, `uvicorn`, `python -m llm_rankings.*`):

```bash
source .venv/bin/activate
```

Package live in `backend/llm_rankings/`. Prefer existing modules (`util`, models, database helpers) over one-off script logic.
